                        Video shoots from around the globe, care in quality, care in flying, care in clients.
                        Video shoots from around the globe, care in quality, care in flying, care in clients.
                    </p>
                </div>
                <div
                    class="grid relative w-full h-fullt text-gray-300 justify-center"
                >
                    <H2 size="default">DJI AVATA FPV</H2>
                     <p class= "grid flex-row relative w-full h-full text-gray-300 justify-center">
                        Video shoots from around the globe, care in quality, care in flying, care in clients.
                        
                        Video shoots from around the globe, care in quality, care in flying, care in clients.
                        
                        Video shoots from around the globe, care in quality, care in flying, care in clients.
